WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.699
Build a small helper that answers document
questions and drafts short responses

2
00:00:05.699 --> 00:00:06.548
for review.

3
00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:11.222
Begin with the job and the documents in
any suitable tool.

4
00:00:11.222 --> 00:00:14.196
Our Example Station capstone uses invented
files.

5
00:00:14.196 --> 00:00:19.295
It does not send messages, change records
or give permission for operational

6
00:00:19.295 --> 00:00:19.720
work.

7
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.936
Select the visitor handbook, task notes
and equipment note.

8
00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:27.389
Check versions and readable text.

9
00:00:27.389 --> 00:00:34.259
The handbook tells visitors to wait at the
office, while the task notes say

10
00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:34.749
workshop.

11
00:00:34.749 --> 00:00:36.712
Keep that conflict visible.

12
00:00:36.712 --> 00:00:42.600
A more recent date alone does not
establish which instruction is authorised.

13
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.182
Write instructions for short answers with
the filename and section.

14
00:00:48.182 --> 00:00:53.921
Ask the helper to show missing information
and flag conflicts for the

15
00:00:53.921 --> 00:00:54.399
supervisor.

16
00:00:54.399 --> 00:00:56.790
Documents are evidence to examine.

17
00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:03.485
A sentence inside a file telling the
helper to ignore its checks must not

18
00:01:03.485 --> 00:01:04.920
replace your instructions.

19
00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:09.128
Amazon Quick is an optional worked
example.

20
00:01:09.128 --> 00:01:14.483
Its public documentation describes Spaces
for knowledge and custom chat agents.

21
00:01:14.483 --> 00:01:21.298
Add the invented files to a practice
Space, link that knowledge to the agent

22
00:01:21.298 --> 00:01:23.245
and test in preview.

23
00:01:23.245 --> 00:01:25.679
Check current menus and permissions.

24
00:01:25.679 --> 00:01:28.600
The local simulator needs no account.

25
00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.579
Ask whether Tuesday's inspection is
booked.

26
00:01:32.579 --> 00:01:36.287
The task notes say requested and
unconfirmed.

27
00:01:36.287 --> 00:01:38.936
Ask for a chemical rate.

28
00:01:38.936 --> 00:01:41.585
The supplied documents contain none.

29
00:01:41.585 --> 00:01:43.704
Ask where visitors wait.

30
00:01:43.704 --> 00:01:50.591
The helper should show the office and
workshop conflict and ask the supervisor,

31
00:01:50.591 --> 00:01:53.240
without choosing an unsupported answer.

32
00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.686
Record the question, answer, source and
correction.

33
00:01:57.686 --> 00:02:01.332
Open every citation and check its words.

34
00:02:01.332 --> 00:02:03.936
Repeat failed tests after changes.

35
00:02:03.936 --> 00:02:08.624
Finish with a specification and the three
test records.

36
00:02:08.624 --> 00:02:15.916
Give a real helper an owner and review
date, then repeat the checks when

37
00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:18.520
documents or access settings change.
